<title>ARGENTINA: SOCCER-ARGENTINA BEAT VENEZUELA 2-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ARGENTINA BEAT VENEZUELA 2-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-07-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina beat Venezuela 2-0 (halftime 1-0) in a South American World Cup qualifier on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers: Hernan Crespo (30), Pablo Paz (56)</p>
<p>Attendance: 65,000</p>
